<title>USA: New York timecharter fixtures - August 29.</title>
<headline>New York timecharter fixtures - August 29.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anniversary (built 1979) 107,140 dwt del Taranto prompt two to four months trading redel Atlantic $7,000 daily VanOmmeren.</p>
<p>Anangel Enosis (built 1995) 73,556 dwt del Australia 15-25/9 trip redel Japan $7,850 daily plus $110,000 bb Navix.</p>
<p>Oceanic Explorer (built 1990) 68,849 dwt del Japan 5-15/9 three to five months trading $8,200 daily Shinwaa.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk 212 859-1640</p>
</text>
